{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50514","headline":"五言同韦子斿神泉诗 · 温翁念","name":"五言同韦子斿神泉诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君泉壑幽，俯裂频阳趾。\n及我性情狎，遥轻武陵涘。\n欿窞明月制，沮𣹤凉风起\n朋来想辟雝，日去疑蒙汜。\n列坐殊满腹，扬清非洗耳。\n髣髴参石斿，淡焉适真理。\n（见《金石萃编》卷六十一。\n）（〖1〗此诗列尹元凯诗刻之後，署作者之名曰「左司郎中温翁念字敬祖」，书者亦爲尹元凯。\n据《新唐书》卷七十二中《宰相世系表》载翁念爲彦博之孙，官大仆少卿。\n此碑署衔左司郎中，盖武后垂拱间仕历也。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温翁念","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}